{"id":"670ed2b3-ebfe-496d-b160-0a43cf503bb9","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"4811e8de3a19178d#1","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/capabilities/findings.ts","baseline":{"blob":"242f2133bc014d6dde344ee7fc345e616b57ca85","start":7869,"end":7873},"shape":{"type":"Identifier","atoms":["gone"]},"context":{"before":"85abc244a234e354","after":"9ce0610fa5c41e79"}},"payload":{"text":"(a file gone — from the terminal as much as the Explorer — takes its findings with it: its\ndocument can stay open with no editor, so no close says so, and its rows in Problems outlived it)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:25:21.208Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:25:21.208Z"}
